{"_note":"拾光物语 ch4 comic pages, same format as mobile/story-comics-ch1.json. Crops are [x,y,w,h] fractions of the 1536x1024 level image.","chapter":"shiguang-ch4","levels":[{"timeLabel":"清晨","intro":"咕咕局长说，水族馆就在镇子下面的海边。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"清晨，小禾来到了海边。"}]},{"crop":[0.4557,0.2441,0.3646,0.4492],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"贝壳形的大门，在水下发着光。"}]},{"crop":[0.2799,0.3418,0.1693,0.2539],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"……喵？"}]},{"crop":[0.0781,0,0.6771,0.5078],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"水族馆……沉在海里？"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"上午","intro":"一个拼图形状的大泡泡，轻轻把她们包住了。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"咕嘟咕嘟——"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"上午，泡泡带着她们往下沉。"}]},{"crop":[0.5859,0.1758,0.2734,0.3516],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"小鱼们围过来看热闹。"}]},{"crop":[0.3385,0.1367,0.1693,0.2539],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"炸毛！"}]},{"crop":[0.026,0.0586,0.5729,0.4297],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"团子，别怕，有泡泡呢。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"中午","intro":"水族馆里，水母像一盏盏灯。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"中午，水族馆的走廊长长的。"}]},{"crop":[0.0521,0.0977,0.2083,0.3125],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"灯都灭了，只剩水母还亮着。"}]},{"crop":[0.4167,0.1172,0.3646,0.4102],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"我是看馆的慢慢……"}]},{"crop":[0.0521,0.0586,0.5859,0.459],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"慢慢说，这里好久没人来了。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"午后","intro":"大厅中间，有一个好大的贝壳。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"午后，贝壳里飘出了好多碎片。"}]},{"crop":[0.3255,0.0879,0.4427,0.5469],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"碎片像水母一样，慢慢地漂。"}]},{"crop":[0.3906,0.4297,0.2344,0.3711],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"啪！"}]},{"crop":[0.0651,0.0977,0.5859,0.4395],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"这是奶奶最早的回忆。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"傍晚","intro":"最后一片，就在贝壳的最里面。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"叮——"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"傍晚，最早的回忆拼好了。"}]},{"crop":[0.4297,0,0.2604,0.3516],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"很久以前，一个小姑娘在这里……"}]},{"crop":[0.625,0,0.3385,0.3223],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"……捡到了第一片会发光的拼图。"}]},{"crop":[0.1302,0.2637,0.651,0.4883],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"原来，拼图小窝是从这里开始的。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"夜里","intro":"月亮升起来了，大家都来到了小窝。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"tl","text":"夜里，拼图小窝的灯全亮了。"}]},{"crop":[0.4036,0.2441,0.2734,0.4102],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"小禾姐姐，包子来啦！"}]},{"crop":[0.6771,0.5078,0.3229,0.3906],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"海底的水族馆，也亮了。"}]},{"crop":[0,0.0391,0.4948,0.3711],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"奶奶，小窝我会好好守着的。"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"拾光镇的故事，还会继续。"}]}]}}]}